{title:\"Use of unofficial AI user agents \\u2014 Perplexity\",children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:\"Evidence of the use of third-party or unidentified AI user agents can be clearly seen in TollBit data. To give an example, the referral rate from Perplexity to multiple domains exceeds the scraping rate. The most plausible explanation for this is that the RAG scrapes that surface the links which generate the referral traffic came from bots that did not identify as 'PerplexityBot' in their user agent string.\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:(0,e.jsx)(t.strong,{children:\"Table 2.A.6. Linkless traffic from Perplexity\"})}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.table,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.thead,{children:(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Domain\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"Total scrapes in Q3 and Q4 2024\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"Total referrals in Q3 and Q4 2024\"})]})}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tbody,{children:[(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Domain A\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"937\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"7,203\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Domain B\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"545\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"10,382\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Domain C\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"577\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"1,920\"})]})]})]})]}),(0,e.jsx)(s,{title:\"Hidden Scraping Activity\",children:(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:`Many scrapers don't announce their user agent when scraping the content from\nthe website. The average number of hidden scrapes per website in Q4 was 1.886M\n(excluding SEO bots). This unidentified scraping is almost equivalent to the\naverage scrapes from AI bots per website for Q4 which was 2M. With hidden\nscrapers operating at nearly the same scale as identified AI bots, we need to\nfind a monetization model that is a true ecosystem solution and incentivizes\nAI bots to identify their user agents and pay in scenarios when their scraping\ndirectly results in a loss of traffic.`})}),(0,e.jsx)(t.h3,{children:\"2.B Cohort Analysis of AI Bot Scraping Levels\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:\"We analyzed a cohort of websites that joined TollBit before Q3. These websites were selected because their bot-blocking strategies remained constant during Q3 and Q4 so that we could see the cleanest view of how AI bot traffic evolved over the two quarters. Our analysis found that AI bot scraping activity increased significantly between these quarters in 2024.\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:\"On average, these sites were scraped 5.05 million times per website in Q4, up from 3.13 million in Q3 \\u2014 an increase of more than 61%. The average number of scrapes per page also rose from 4.2 to 5.0, reflecting a 19% increase in per-page scraping.\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:(0,e.jsx)(t.strong,{children:\"Table 2.B.1. Average AI user agent scraping rates Q3 vs Q4\"})}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.table,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.thead,{children:(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Metric\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"Q3 2024\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"Q4 2024\"})]})}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tbody,{children:[(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Average scraping rate per website\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"3,127,608\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"5,050,539\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Average scraping rate per page\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"4.2\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"5.0\"})]})]})]}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:(0,e.jsx)(t.strong,{children:\"Figure 2.B.1. Average per-page, per-website AI user agent scraping rates\"})}),(0,e.jsx)(r,{src:\"/state-of-the-bots/q4-2024/Figure 2.B.1. Average per-page, per-website AI user agent scraping rates.svg\",alt:\"Average per-page, per-website AI user agent scraping rates\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.h3,{children:\"2.B.2 Scraping Levels by Bots\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:\"A closer look at AI bot activity within the cohort analysis reveals substantial differences in scraping patterns among various AI user agents. ChatGPT-User exhibited the most aggressive growth, increasing its scraping activity by 6,767.60% quarter-over-quarter. Other notable increases include Timpibot (+1,323.58%), ClaudeBot (+566.79%), and DuckAssistBot (+248.64%).\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:(0,e.jsx)(t.strong,{children:\"Figure 2.B.2. Q3 vs Q4 percentage change in total scraping by AI bots\"})}),(0,e.jsx)(r,{src:\"/state-of-the-bots/q4-2024/Figure 2.B.2. Q3 vs Q4 percentage change in total scraping by AI bots.svg\",alt:\"Q3 vs Q4 percentage change in total scraping by AI bots\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.h3,{children:\"2.B.3 User Agent Per Page Scraping Levels (Q3 vs Q4)\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.p,{children:(0,e.jsx)(t.strong,{children:\"Table 2.B.3. User agent per page scraping levels for Q3 vs Q4\"})}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.table,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.thead,{children:(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"User agent\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"Q3 total scrapes / page\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"Q4 total scrapes / page\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.th,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"Percentage Change\"})]})}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tbody,{children:[(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"OAI-SearchBot\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"3.2\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"18.0\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"461.65%\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"FacebookBot\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"1.3\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"4.0\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"210.32%\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"PerplexityBot\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"2.9\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"5.0\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"72.91%\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"ChatGPT-User\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"26.6\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"35.5\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"33.63%\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Timpibot\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"2.2\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"2.8\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"30.75%\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"omgili\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"4.2\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"5.1\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"22.93%\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"DuckAssistBot\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"2.1\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"2.6\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"center\"},children:\"22.64%\"})]}),(0,e.jsxs)(t.tr,{children:[(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{textAlign:\"left\"},children:\"Ai2Bot\"}),(0,e.jsx)(t.td,{style:{